      en: "The Alcatraz Lighthouse, located on São Vicente Island, is a historic beacon completed in 1882. Standing 21 meters tall, it was built from local stone to guide ships into Porto Grande. The lighthouse has undergone several upgrades, including a solar-powered system installed in 1998. It remains an active aid to navigation and a popular landmark for visitors interested in maritime heritage.",
